  926:                                 ; diag_fuel_sol_response_P0606_5F53
  927:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: Runs with battery inside CAL_diag_MIN/MAXBATT, ECT > MINECTS, RPM > MINRPM and fuel
  928:                                 ;        commanded. MEAS_INJ_RSP below CAL_diag_MINRSP counts $1A92 and above CAL_diag_MAXRSP counts $1A93;
  929:                                 ;        reaching k_368D sets P1216 (response too short) or P1217 (too long). Also P0606 (counter $1A90): measured
  930:                                 ;        pump timing > kw_36FA or TIO $146A > kw_36FC for k_36FE passes. Finally it selects the timing source into
  931:                                 ;        $193D
