 1744:                                 ;        timestamp (TCNT>>4 plus overflow extension, corrected for a pending overflow) in VEH_SPD_4K_CT.
 1745:                                 ;   OBD1 PAISVC_4KPPMI (match 0.80 p1-global): Pulse accumulator interrupt, 4004 ppmi interrupt input
 1746:                                 ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
