 3311:                                 ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 3312:                                 ; interp_2D_table
 3313:                                 ;   analysis [high]: Entry with A=input and B=interval count: scales the input to index and fraction, skips the
 3314:                                 ;        header, and interpolates (falls into 6D0A).
 3315:                                 ;   OBD1 LEE58 (match 1.00 p1-call): Another entry to 2D Interpolated Lookup with args:
 3316:                                 ;   A = Col Count
 3317:                                 ;   B = Coefficent
 3318:                                 ;   X = Row Pointer
 3319:                                 ;   called from: lookup_3D_table
 3320:                                 ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
