 5396:                                 ; diag_cylbal_at_min_limit_7B08
 5397:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: Misfire/cyl-balance diagnostic: when enabled (mask k_3811.0, ENGMODEFLAG.4, ECT between
 5398:                                 ;        k_37CD and k_37CE) and after a k_37CF-tick delay, checks each of the 8 CYL_BAL_ADAPT words against
 5399:                                 ;        CAL_CYLBAL_MINADJ. A cylinder pinned at the minimum adjust sets its P030x; more than one pinned sets
 5400:                                 ;        P0300. Array order = firing order 8,7,2,6,5,4,3,1.
 5401:                                 ;   called from: calc_TASKFLAGS1_C701
