 6620:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: OBD1 L79B6: if the pedal is >= CAL_SAFE_APP_LIM, RPM > CAL_SAFE_RPM_LIM and there is no APP
 6621:                                 ;        fault, a range change N/R->D or into R loads the safe-limit timers 1873/1874 from CAL_SAFE_LIM_TM1/2
 6622:                                 ;        (fuel limit for 'power shift' protection).
 6623:                                 ;   OBD1 L79B6 (match 0.96 p1-global): 40hz - 25ms
 6624:                                 ;   This code checks for shifts between neutral/reverse/drive
 6625:                                 ;   with rpm and throttle above thresholds and sets a timer
