 7672:                                 ; PCS_PWM_output
 7673:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: Writes the PCS (force motor) duty to PWM 1809 and a copy at $1BAF. A tester device-control
 7674:                                 ;        override ($1C5B.2 accepted) forces duty 0/FF from $1C5C.2, and 1807.4 forces 0. In gear 0 it runs a
 7675:                                 ;        force-motor cleaning pulse sequence: low phase kw_4AB8 ticks, then FF phase kw_4ABA ticks, repeated up to
 7676:                                 ;        k_4AB7 cycles. Otherwise the duty is PCS_duty_cmd.
 7677:                                 ;   called from: Central_Scheduler
