 7749:                                 ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 7750:                                 ; calc_OLD_RPM2_4_8B43
 7751:                                 ;   analysis [low]: 50 ms: while fuel_quantity=0, [$B2] >= k_2755 and RPM above IDLE_SPEED_HIGH_BAND and $50,
 7752:                                 ;        counts RPM-rising samples (DELTA_RPM_COUNT), large RPM jumps >= kw_2757 ([$BD]) and trans slip ([$B9],
 7753:                                 ;        auto trans). Sets $54.2 when the counts pass the k_2752/k_2754/k_2756 limits, i.e. engine speed rising
 7754:                                 ;        with no fuel commanded (driveline-driven or runaway). Holds OLD_RPM2_4 as the previous RPM.
 7755:                                 ;   OBD1 L9E24 (match 1.00 p1-exact): seems related to engine shutdown of some kind... don't know what this does
 7756:                                 ;        yet.
 7757:                                 ;   inferred [B, pass A]: writes OLD_RPM2_4, DELTA_RPM_COUNT
 7758:                                 ;   called from: run_50ms_job
