 8967:                                 ; validate_tester_PCS_override_935D
 8968:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: Checks a J1850 tester device-control request to override the PCS (line pressure) setpoint
 8969:                                 ;        (request 1C5A.4, value 1C5F, written by bank-1 handler E6F8). It accepts the request (1C5B.4=1) if 1C5F
 8970:                                 ;        is between k_4D11 and k_4D10 and either the vehicle is in P/N with RPM below kw_4D0E or, in gear, the
 8971:                                 ;        value is <= the normal setpoint 1BB0. Otherwise it rejects it (1C5D.4=1). 1C59.2 forces mode 1 (sets 1C5
 8972:                                 ;   called from: far_b0_935D_7D8B, Central_Scheduler
 8973:                                 ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
