 9038:                                 ; apply_tester_shift_adapt_reset_93D9
 9039:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: Handles tester override request 1C5A.5: copies value bit 1C5C.5 into 1B70.7 and marks the
 9040:                                 ;        override active (1C5B.5). 1B70.7 is consumed by calc_SHIFTPAT_SELECT_part_CA24, which reloads the RAM
 9041:                                 ;        shift-adapt tables from ROM defaults. In practice this is a tester-commanded adapt reset.
 9042:                                 ;   called from: Central_Scheduler
 9043:                                 ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
