 9063:                                 ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 9064:                                 ; calc_pcs_sol_setpt
 9065:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: Calculates the PCS (force motor) setpoint 1BB0 from line_pressure_desired and
 9066:                                 ;        trans_temp_filtered using a 3D offset table (tbl_4850 or the identical tblOfs3D_4974, chosen by
 9067:                                 ;        hysteresis flag $86.6 with band t17_4A98[temp*3] around tracked pressure 1BAA). Uses the tester value
 9068:                                 ;        1C5F when the override is active, and forces 0 in trans fault mode (FMEM2.3) or when 1C59.3 is set. OBD1
 9069:                                 ;        calc_pcs_sol_setpt,
 9070:                                 ;   OBD1 calc_pcs_sol_setpt (match 0.73 p2-global): 25ms - 40hz
 9071:                                 ;   called from: Central_Scheduler
