 9188:                                 ;   analysis [high]: Writes shift solenoids A/B (IOR_1800 b4/b5) from the solenoid pattern for the current gear,
 9189:                                 ;        or for the tester gear 1C5E when override 1C5B.0 is active. The pattern table is chosen by tbl_3864.7.
 9190:                                 ;        Also drives the PCS low-side driver (1800.7): on normally, and switched off after a one-pass delay
 9191:                                 ;        ($86.3/.4) when trans fault mode (FMEM2.3, or $8A.6 with tbl_4AC4.4) is active.
