 9248:                                 ; decode_range_switch_PRNDL
 9249:                                 ;   analysis [high]: Reads the perf/manual switches and builds SHIFTPAT_SELECT from table 960E. It also packs A/C,
 9250:                                 ;        range switches A/B/C, 4WD-low and PTO into a temp byte, which becomes DS_DISCOLD (previous-state copy),
 9251:                                 ;        and updates DS_DIFLAGS A/C and cruise bits. Range switches A/B/C are decoded via PRNDL_decode_table_ACB
 9252:                                 ;        into Cal_bit_6_store (PRNDL), and $1886 counts time in the current position. If the lever is in D2
 9253:                                 ;   OBD1 L8556 (match 0.81 p1-global): 25ms - 40hz
 9254:                                 ;   Mostly shift position/cruise/4x4 checks and flag updates
 9255:                                 ;   called from: run_25ms_job, Central_Scheduler
