 9622:                                 ; engine_load_from_fuel_demand
 9623:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: Mid-function entry of calc_tp_for_transmission (OBD1 L86E5), also called from
 9624:                                 ;        pedal_select_filter. It converts CRUISE_FUEL_REQ_NO_DERATE into a pseudo-throttle value by piecewise
 9625:                                 ;        interpolation between Fuel_demand_map_0..3 (each indexed by CRUISE_RPM_CAP), then filters it into
 9626:                                 ;        engine_load_est_filtered.
 9627:                                 ;   OBD1 L86E5 (match 1.00 p1-exact)
 9628:                                 ;   called from: pedal_select_filter
