 9735:                                 ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 9736:                                 ; calc_output_and_vehicle_speed_982B
 9737:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: Calculates TRANS_OUTPUT_SPEED and vehicle speed. Normally it uses OSS raw speed, holding
 9738:                                 ;        the last value while 1BDD/1BDF are nonzero and zeroing it without ignition. In OSS-fault backup (FMEM2
 9739:                                 ;        b2/b7 with tbl_4AC5 enables) it estimates output speed from input speed ($18A2) or engine speed ($1897)
 9740:                                 ;        divided by the current gear ratio. Results are filtered with CAL_OSS_FILTER; vehicle speed = output / CA
 9741:                                 ;   OBD1 L879C (match 0.56 p2-dataref): 25ms - 40hz
 9742:                                 ;   called from: Central_Scheduler
 9743:                                 ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
