10402:                                 ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
10403:                                 ; diag_P0751_shift_sol_A_perf_9D5A
10404:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: Shift solenoid A performance test (tbl_3864.7, k_3816.1 enable). Runs with steady
10405:                                 ;        conditions (VSS, load, fuel, RPM, $1884 windows, trans temp 1BCE >= k_4C07, not 4WD, not P/N/R). It
10406:                                 ;        compares ratio $1C12 with tbl_4CBB windows: inside the adjacent gear's window for tbl_4C0D[gear] counts
10407:                                 ;        flags a wrong gear, and outside its own window for k_4C0C flags a fault. Fault bits accumulate in 1BC6;
10408:                                 ;        fail count
10409:                                 ;   called from: RUN_DIAGS_AUTO_TRANS
