13583:                                 ; calc_kickdown_and_load_rate_B3C2
13584:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: Sets DS_DIFLAGS.4 (kickdown) when load state $18E2 rises above k_385B (2WD) / k_3859 (4WD),
13585:                                 ;        not in manual. It clears it below k_385C / k_385A. It computes load rate $18D5 (signed per-call delta)
13586:                                 ;        for tip-out ($6B.0, hold timer $18D6=k_389B) and tip-in ($6A.3) flags. It also sets $6A.6 VSS-high
13587:                                 ;        hysteresis (k_3894/k_3895) and $6A.7 light-load hysteresis, whose thresholds depend on $6A.6.
