13683:                                 ; calc_powertrain_in_motion_B489
13684:                                 ;   analysis [high]: 25 ms. Sets DS_STATUS.7 (powertrain in motion) as soon as engine speed >= kw_385D, output
13685:                                 ;        speed >= kw_385F or turbine speed >= kw_3861. Clears it after k_3848 consecutive calls with all three
13686:                                 ;        below threshold (counter $18ED).
13687:                                 ;   OBD1 L8AE6 (match 1.00 p1-exact): 25ms - 40hz
13688:                                 ;   called from: Central_Scheduler
13689:                                 ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
13690:     B489                        calc_powertrain_in_motion_B489:
