13935:                                 ;   analysis [low]: Rebuilds one-hot selector bytes, probably used to index shift/TCC/pressure schedules. $74 =
13936:                                 ;        manual/cruise/normal. $73 = trans-hot/cruise/normal. $75 = coolant-hot/trans-hot/normal/4WD. $76.0 is
13937:                                 ;        always set. $1876 = 0 in reverse, else gear*4 (12 for gear>3), +2 when gear index is 0 or TCC is in
13938:                                 ;        release/slip modes (DS_TCCMODE.2-.4).
