14069:                                 ; abg_tracking_filter_B709
14070:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: Generic 3-state tracking filter with stack arguments (meas, gain table ptr, pos, rate,
14071:                                 ;        accel). It computes the error meas-pos with a +-1 deadband (rates zeroed), then corrects pos, rate and
14072:                                 ;        accel using gains [tbl+0], [tbl+2], [tbl+4] via MULS32 (>>2) plus sub_B7E6 prediction terms with [tbl+6].
14073:                                 ;        All results are signed-saturated.
14074:                                 ;   called from: calc_engine_speed_tracking_B6CF
