14254:                                 ; calc_TCC_slip_speed_B7F8
14255:                                 ;   analysis [low]: Signed speed difference [$1897] - [$18A8] (most likely engine speed minus turbine speed, i.e.
14256:                                 ;        torque converter slip), saturated to 16 bits and filtered with FILTER2 (coefficient tbl_3891) into $1B01;
14257:                                 ;        |slip| goes to $1AFD. Flag $6A.5 is set when slip < kw_43A8 (-640) and cleared when slip > kw_43AA (+1),
14258:                                 ;        so it means negative slip (coast or overrun).
14259:                                 ;   inferred [B, pass A]: writes TCC_slip_speed, TCC_slip_abs
14260:                                 ;   called from: Central_Scheduler
14261:                                 ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
