14283:     B822 BC 43A8                        cpx >kw_43A8                        ; B822  BC 43 A8      compare X with kw_43A8
14284:     B825 2C 05                          bge loc_B82C                        ; B825  2C 05         if X >= (signed) kw_43A8 goto loc_B82C
