14295:                                 ; calc_measured_gear_ratio_B835
14296:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: Computes the gear ratio used for shift monitoring into $1877 (x8192 fixed point). In trans
14297:                                 ;        failure mode (TRANS_FMEM_ENA_FLAGS.2) it uses the fixed ratio table entry. If tbl_3864.7 is clear it
14298:                                 ;        copies the commanded ratio $1889. Otherwise it divides input speed by output speed with sub_68BC, using
14299:                                 ;        an FDIV branch for overdrive (ratio < 1, gear k_3890) and scaling by $1889. The scaling by $1889 is not
14300:                                 ;   called from: Central_Scheduler
