14365:                                 ; calc_4WD_and_PTO_flags_B8A4
14366:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: Decodes the debounced 4WD-low switch (IN_1802 .3) into DS_DIFLAGS.5, with switch polarity
14367:                                 ;        from tbl_383F.4 and the previous state in DS_DISCOLD.7. Decodes the PTO input (RAM_status_resistor.0)
14368:                                 ;        into DS_DIFLAGS.7, polarity from tbl_383F.5. Then sets the trans mode code $6F to 1 (override,
14369:                                 ;        $8B.0/$1BCA/tbl_4AC4, or both flags set), 12 (4WD), 2 (PTO) or 4 (normal). $1BE2 is a saturating timer
14370:                                 ;        cleared on
14371:                                 ;   called from: decode_range_switch_PRNDL
