15034:                                 ; detect_garage_shift_BD4F
15035:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: Compares the PRNDL position Cal_bit_6_store with the previous one in $60 and writes a
15036:                                 ;        garage-shift code to $62. N/P to Drive gives 1 or 2, depending on whether TC slip $1B01 is below a trans-
15037:                                 ;        temperature-based limit (tbl_3BCE, or kw_3BEA when hot). N/P to Reverse gives 4 or 8 by the same test.
15038:                                 ;        Drive to N/P gives $10, Reverse to N/P gives $20. No change gives 0.
15039:                                 ;   called from: Central_Scheduler
