16004:                                 ; calc_garage_adapt_loop_idx_C445
16005:                                 ;   analysis [low]: Garage-shift (N->D / N->R engagement) adaptive learning. It runs once per engagement: 1B5F b4
16006:                                 ;        set, no inhibit bits in 1B40, 1B5F b6 not yet set, ignition on. The error is measured value 1B2A*k_3E7F
16007:                                 ;        minus target 1B28 (signed, 1B38) and is shaped by a gain curve into 1B39. The result is spread over up to
16008:                                 ;        5 trans-temp cells (weights tbl_3EA2) of KAM table $0307 or $02F8 (chosen by engagement type 1B3
16009:                                 ;   inferred [B, pass A]: writes garage_adapt_loop_idx, KAM_garage_adapt_chksum
