16591:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: Per-shift adaptive pressure learning. Status/selection is in 1B5E (b7 = learning disabled).
16592:                                 ;        It picks a signed correction 1B68 from one of four cases: shift too long vs d_C384 (tbl_433F), hot/high-
16593:                                 ;        load (tbl_4311+29), error 1B60 below limit (tbl_4311+35), or the normal case from per-gear curve d_C38A
16594:                                 ;        indexed by error 1B60. The case is only taken when inhibit words 1B5B/1B5C/1B5D are zero. It then up
16595:                                 ;   called from: upshift_adapt_sequencer_D301
