19496:                                 ;        (selected by flags $73/$75/$76 via trans_task_EBF2). Normal pattern: 17-pt tables vs trans_load_filtered;
19497:                                 ;        kickdown pattern: fixed bytes. The two values are blended by the altitude factor (diag_P0602_EC22).
19498:                                 ;        Raised to tbl_43D2[gear] with A/C on ($80.6) and to k_43A6 when trans is hot ($80.7). Sets $7C.6 (apply
19499:                                 ;        sp
