19617:                                 ; calc_TCC_apply_release_bits_DC9A
19618:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: Runs the TCC apply-delay timer $1B08: when $80.5 is set it is preset to k_4580 (+k_4582 if
19619:                                 ;        $1B07 is still running) and $1B07 is preset to k_4581; otherwise both count down to 0. It then turns the
19620:                                 ;        apply-speed-met ($7C.6) and release-request ($7C.7) bits into $7C.4 (apply allowed, timer expired) and
19621:                                 ;        $7C.5 (release).
19622:                                 ;   called from: TCC_control_50ms_DD5F
19623:                                 ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
