19740:                                 ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
19741:                                 ; TCC_control_50ms_DD5F
19742:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: Top-level TCC routine called from run_50ms_job. Steps: inhibit flags (E09D), slip-counter
19743:                                 ;        bands (E396), FMEM flags (DC60), A/C/hot flags (DB99). When TCC is released/idle it calculates the apply
19744:                                 ;        speed (DBC6); when applying/slipping or a release reason is active it runs the release logic (E20A),
19745:                                 ;        slip-mode enable (DE32) and light-load flag (DF62). It then builds the request ($82) and steps the DS_TC
19746:                                 ;   called from: run_50ms_job
