19775:                                 ; TCC_mode_state_machine_DD93
19776:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: TCC mode state machine. Row = index of the one-hot request in $82 (0..7). Column = index of
19777:                                 ;        the current DS_TCCMODE state with bit 6 masked off. The next DS_TCCMODE comes from the 8x7 table d_DDFA
19778:                                 ;        (code-space, not calibratable). The previous mode is saved to $7B. If there is no request or DS_TCCMODE
19779:                                 ;        is 0, it goes to state $01.
