19858:                                 ; calc_TCC_slip_target_DE32
19859:                                 ;   analysis [low]: Enable/abort logic for controlled-slip TCC operation. Timer $1B10 counts while $83.3 is clear;
19860:                                 ;        $83.0 = time-in >= k_46FD. Slip target $1B11 = tblOfs3D_45BA[load, turbine speed]*8 (or the override
19861:                                 ;        $1B05). $83.3 latches after k_46F8 counts once filtered slip $1B01 drops below target+kw_46F6. Slip below
19862:                                 ;        target+kw_46F9 for k_46FB counts aborts ($83.0 clear, $84.4 set). Everything is reset when out of
19863:                                 ;   inferred [B, pass A]: writes TCC_slip_target; tables TRANS_line_pressure_base
19864:                                 ;   called from: TCC_control_50ms_DD5F
