20194:                                 ;        option bits. Reasons: gear 1 ($7F.7), PRNDL/gear ($7E.0), trans temp window ($7E.1, X+8/X+9 hysteresis),
20195:                                 ;        coolant temp window ($7E.2, $18DB), brake ($7E.3), $6B.0 ($7E.4), post-shift timer $1AE2 ($7E.5/$7F.0),
20196:                                 ;        cold trans with tbl_457E hysteresis ($7F.2), FMEM gear ($7F.3). $7C.0 = any reason set. A force-motor ad
