20526:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: Slip error = (|slip| $1AFD - target $1B11)/4, stored in $1B21 and clamped to -80..+240. It
20527:                                 ;        is mapped to 0..255 ((e+80)*4/5) and looked up in t17_46DE to give the integrator step (D = 0:step). A
20528:                                 ;        non-zero $1AE0 overrides the step.
