21180:                                 ; update_current_gear_E88E
21181:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: 50 ms. Copies the commanded gear 1AC1 into trans_gear_AT (0-based gear) and sets $77.0 on
21182:                                 ;        upshift or $77.3 on downshift. If override byte 1AB9 is non-zero (forced gear, 1-based, clamped to
21183:                                 ;        k_3890+1 = 4 gears), it uses 1AB9-1 instead and sets 1AC8=$FF.
21184:                                 ;   called from: run_50ms_job
21185:                                 ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
