21216:                                 ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
21217:                                 ; calc_upshift_RPM_projection_adapt_E8C2
21218:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: 50 ms. Works out the shift delay for the current gear: a 1st-gear term from tcurve_3B67
21219:                                 ;        (time in 1st/P-R-N), a base value from a 17-pt table vs trans temp (3B34/3B45/3B56) and an adaptive cell
21220:                                 ;        for the temp band (RAM 02EB..). It projects engine speed at shift completion into 1AD1 = engine speed +
21221:                                 ;        rate*delay; the shift scheduler compares 1AD1 with the RPM target in 1ADA. After each upshift it measur
21222:                                 ;   called from: run_50ms_job
