21523:                                 ; interp_4cell_by_temp_EAD6
21524:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: Linear interpolation across a 4-cell array at X: A = input (trans temp), B = 3 segments.
21525:                                 ;        A*3 high byte = cell index and low byte = fraction. Returns X[i] + (X[i+1]-X[i])*frac in A. Used to read
21526:                                 ;        the adaptive shift-delay cells.
21527:                                 ;   OBD1 LEFBE (match 0.93 p1-global)
21528:                                 ;   called from: calc_upshift_RPM_projection_adapt_E8C2
