21930:     ECB1                        loc_ECB1:
21931:     ECB1 BD 7E03                        jsr >far_calc_sensor_pullup_range_7E03; ECB1  BD 7E 03      call bank 1 via far_calc_sensor_pullup_range_7E03
21932:     ECB4                        loc_ECB4:
