22128:                                 ; baro_from_MAP
22129:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: Baro estimate from MAP (Turbo_ram_address*2). On NA engines (200C.6) or with the engine
22130:                                 ;        stopped it uses MAP directly. On a running turbo engine it keeps min(baro, MAP) and fully re-learns from
22131:                                 ;        MAP only after $5D.6 (low load) has held for k_baro_learn_loops (60) passes.
22132:                                 ;   called from: run_100ms_engine_tasks_EC95
