23066:                                 ;   analysis [low]: 10 Hz engine-stop/shutoff solenoid driver. Writes PORTG bit0 (bit set = allowed/run, bit clear
23067:                                 ;        = stop). Run/stall logic uses RPM thresholds k_323A/k_322F, a first-gear counter 1997 (k_3238) and a not-
23068:                                 ;        first-gear counter 1998 (k_3239). Latch flag 1999.0 and counter 00B1 (k_2750). Needs battery >= 4.9 V.
23069:                                 ;        Supports a serial device-control override (1CC5/1CC6 .2), refused above VSS k_203A (reply code $3
23070:                                 ;   OBD1 DO_ENG_STOP_SOL (match 0.83 p1-global): 100ms - 10hz
