23186:                                 ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
23187:                                 ; ignition_off_powerdown_F615
23188:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: Handles ignition off. With battery/IGN >= 4.9 V it just clears 0091.3 and the 1DA9 counter
23189:                                 ;        (if non-zero). With IGN < 4.9 V it sets FLAGS0.2, resets backup-fuel and timer state, sets limp flags and
23190:                                 ;        clears DTCs P0251/P0335/P0370 unless they failed this trip. It also clears the missed-reference counters
23191:                                 ;        and counts 1DA9 up to k_329E (100). When the glow state is 7 (or 0009.0 is set, and the anti-theft
23192:                                 ;   called from: run_100ms_engine_tasks_EC95
