23577:                                 ; select_glow_ctrl_temp_F93E
23578:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: Picks the temperature used by glow-plug control. It uses ECT, but switches to IAT when the
23579:                                 ;        ECT sensor is faulted, or when the battery ADC >= k_307B and ECT < k_307D and ECT + k_307E < IAT. If IAT
23580:                                 ;        is faulted it always uses ECT. Result goes to glow_ctrl_temp (1813).
