24338:                                 ; GET_BACKUP_MEAS_INJ_TMG
24339:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: Backup (cam-sensor) injection-timing measurement. It limits PUMP_TO_TDC_TIME_BKUP against
24340:                                 ;        reference period + latency (kw_2051). It converts the time to an angle through sub_6A3F with engine_RPM,
24341:                                 ;        then sub_6A3F with ANTISTALL_DASHPOT_TMR, then averages it 50/50 into BKUP_MEAS_INJ_TIMING.
24342:                                 ;   OBD1 GET_BACKUP_MEAS_INJ_TMG (match 0.99 p1-global): Calculate backup mode CKP signal
